{"2244030":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"RUBATO","steam_appid":2244030,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4513070],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RUBATO, an experimental, 2D physics-based take on the collect-a-thon genre!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2244030\/extras\/03f4b199306110c0e47676469f953db4.avif?t=1795108244\" width=422 height=557 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The year is 12,012. Multiquadrillionaire monopoly &quot;GSSAI CO.&quot; has been in power of the universe for centuries after a world-ending bioweapon was unleashed onto the masses. And now? The solar system has been destroyed by unknown celestial forces. A weapons development program run by the Earth subsidiary of &quot;GSSAI CO.&quot; is fast progressing. And the world's denizens are disappearing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">That is until one man screws up a game of pool.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">HERO OF THE STARS AND THE SKY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2244030\/extras\/ba97067e23da4e4d367a76b96a3ceec6.poster.avif?t=1795108244\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2244030\/extras\/ba97067e23da4e4d367a76b96a3ceec6.webm?t=1795108244\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2244030\/extras\/ba97067e23da4e4d367a76b96a3ceec6.mp4?t=1795108244\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your tongue to lick enemies and objects as you make your way through open metroidvania-like areas, whilst collecting &quot;Planet Bits&quot; to help fix the solar system!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">WELCOME TO RUBATO WORLD<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2244030\/extras\/63ab33ba012c056824ee49dc04e1120c.poster.avif?t=1795108244\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2244030\/extras\/63ab33ba012c056824ee49dc04e1120c.webm?t=1795108244\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2244030\/extras\/63ab33ba012c056824ee49dc04e1120c.mp4?t=1795108244\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 compact, densely packed areas ranging from a huge sprawling bakery to the world's most poorly planned city. Uncover secrets and shortcuts in every corner of the world.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">IF I COULD ONLY LOVE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2244030\/extras\/ceda961356e012e5abf38fd781dc93d5.poster.avif?t=1795108244\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2244030\/extras\/ceda961356e012e5abf38fd781dc93d5.webm?t=1795108244\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source sr